            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство </p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 ((7^{-x^{2}}-3)\\times (7^{-x^{2}+16}-1))+\\log_2 \\frac{7^{-x^{2}}-3}{7^{-x^{2}+16}-1}\\gt \\log_2 (7^{7-x^{2}}-2)^{2}\"></span> . </span></p></center>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T10:31:23.501103+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p> <span data-inline-latex=\"(-\\infty;-4)\\cup (4;+\\infty)\"></span> .</p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T10:31:23.501103+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"t=7^{-x^{2}},\\quad 0\\lt t\\le 1\"></span>, тогда не­ра­вен­ство при­ни­ма­ет вид:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 ((t-3)(7^{16}t-1))+\\log_2 \\frac{t-3}{7^{16}t-1}\\gt \\log_2 (7^{7}t-2)^{2}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Так как <span data-inline-latex=\"t-3\\lt 0\"></span>, имеем <span data-inline-latex=\"7^{16}t-1\\lt 0\"></span>, а зна­чит, <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{7^{16}}\\lt \\frac{2}{7^{7}}\"></span> .  </p><p>По­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\log_2 (t-3)^{2}\\gt \\log_2 (7^{7}t-2)^{2}\\\\0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{7^{16}}\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\left|t-3\\right|\\gt \\left|7^{7}t-2\\right|\\\\0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{7^{16}}\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}3-t\\gt 2-7^{7}t\\\\0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{7^{16}}\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff 0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{7^{16}}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>По­яс­ним: не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"3-t\\gt 2-7^{7}t\"></span> эк­ви­ва­лент­но не­ра­вен­ству  <span data-inline-latex=\"(7^{7}-1)t\\gt -1\"></span> и вы­пол­не­но для всех зна­че­ний пе­ре­мен­ной. Итак,</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"7^{(-x)^{2}}\\lt 7^{-16}\\iff x^{2}\\gt 16\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\gt 4\\\\x\\lt -4\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
