            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_7 ((5^{-x^{2}}-5)(5^{-x^{2}+16}-1))+\\log_7 \\frac{5^{-x^{2}}-5}{5^{-x^{2}+16}-1}\\gt \\log_7 (5^{13-x^{2}}-4)^{2}\"></span> . </p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T10:31:23.754069+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p> <span data-inline-latex=\"(-\\infty,-4)\\cup (4,+\\infty)\"></span> .</p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T10:31:23.754069+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"t=5^{-x^{2}},\\quad 0\\lt t\\le 1\"></span>, тогда не­ра­вен­ство при­ни­ма­ет вид:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_7 ((t-5)(5^{16}t-1))+\\log_7 \\frac{t-5}{5^{16}t-1}\\gt \\log_7 (5^{13}t-4)^{2}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Оче­вид­но <span data-inline-latex=\"t-5\\lt 0\"></span>, по­это­му <span data-inline-latex=\"5^{16}t-1\\lt 0\"></span>, то есть <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{5^{16}}\"></span> .  За­ме­тим также, что  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1}{5^{16}}\\lt \\frac{4}{5^{13}}\"></span> ,  по­это­му боль­ше ни­ка­ких огра­ни­че­ний на <i>t</i> не воз­ни­ка­ет. По­лу­ча­ем: </p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\log_7 (t-5)^{2}\\gt \\log_7 (5^{13}t-4)^{2}\\\\0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{5^{16}}\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\left|t-5\\right|\\gt \\left|5^{13}t-4\\right|\\\\0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{5^{16}}\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}5-t\\gt 4-5^{13}t\\\\0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{5^{16}}\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff 0\\lt t\\lt \\frac{1}{5^{16}}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>Тогда </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"5^{-x^{2}}\\lt 5^{-16}\\iff x^{2}\\gt 16\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\gt 4\\\\x\\lt -4\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
